--Description: We need the percentage of 2015 crashes (Jan-Aug) that
--  a) involve more than one distinct person (denominator) and
--  b) also have more than one person with severe injuries (injury_severity = 4) (numerator).
-- Steps in-SQL:
-- 1. Filter to months 1-8 in 2015 person table.
-- 2. multi_person CTE: keep crash IDs (st_case) with COUNT(DISTINCT person_number) > 1.
-- 3. multi_severe CTE: keep crash IDs with COUNTIF(injury_severity = 4) > 1.
-- 4. Join the two CTEs so we only evaluate crashes meeting criterion (a).
-- 5. Return numerator, denominator, and rounded percentage.
